"Plural-Forms: nplurals=4; plural=(n==1 ? 0 : (n%10>=2 && n%10<=4) && (n%100<12 || n%100>14) ? 1 : n!=1 && (n%10>=0 && n%10<=1) || (n%10>=5 && n%10<=9) || (n%100>=12 && n%100<=14) ? 2 : 3);\n"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I tried to build a makeshift radio.  All I get is static and an occasional "
"eerie whisper.  Maybe I'm going mad.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"If you're reading this, I'm heading to the old church.  It seems safer "
"there.  The walls are thick, and I need some peace.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I heard a child laughing today.  It was just in my head.  Has to be.  "
"There's no way a child could survive this.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The water smells strange.  Can't remember the last time I drank something "
"that didn't taste like chemicals.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They found me.  I can hear them scratching at the door.  If anyone finds "
"this, I'm sorry I couldn't make it.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Every night, I dream of the beach.  The sound of waves.  The smell of salt."
"  Waking up is the worst part.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"There are eyes in the dark.  Watching.  Waiting.  I can't stay here any "
"longer.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"All the lights are out.  It's like the world is sleeping.  Or maybe it's "
"dead.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found a stash of old comic books.  For a few moments, I was a kid again."
"  Then reality set back in.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Met a guy today.  Said he's immune.  Bullshit, right?  No one is immune.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Ran out of ammo today.  Guess it's back to the good old-fashioned baseball "
"bat.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"My watch stopped working.  Funny how something so small can make you feel "
"completely lost.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"If you find this, head to the old mill on the outskirts.  There's a safe "
"place there.  For now.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I think the government knew about this.  They were prepared.  We're just "
"the collateral damage.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Saw a plane today.  Low and slow.  Could be a sign of hope, or just another"
" trap.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I forget what the world was like before.  It's like a distant "
"memory, fading away.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"My hands are shaking so badly, I can barely write.  Not sure if it's fear "
"or the cold.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Heard gunshots last night.  Not sure if that means someone survived or "
"someone else died.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The nights are the worst.  That's when the voices come.  Whispering things "
"I don't want to hear.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Why do the zombies avoid the old cemetery?  It's like something even they "
"fear.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I miss hot showers.  Hell, I miss being clean.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"There's a weird fungus growing everywhere.  I'm starting to think it's not "
"just a plant.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The sky looks different now.  Like it's always twilight.  The sun never "
"fully rises.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"If I make it through this, I swear I'll never complain about anything ever "
"again.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Saw a woman today, just standing there, staring at the sky.  She didn't "
"even notice me.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found an old music box.  It still works.  Played it for a while, trying "
"to remember happier times.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Why did this happen?  Who's to blame?  Was it us?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I think it would be easier to just give up.  But then I think of "
"you, and I keep going.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They're evolving.  Saw one today that looked almost… not human.  God help "
"us.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Found an old map.  Marked a few places I want to check out.  Maybe there's "
"hope out there.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The smell of death is everywhere.  It's inescapable.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Met a trader today.  Bartered some ammo for food.  There's still a spark of"
" humanity left.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I saw a pack of wild dogs today.  They're surviving better than we are.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Got bit today.  Not sure how much time I have left.  Just wanted to say I "
"love you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"If you find this, know that I tried my best.  I hope you fare better.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They say there's a safe zone in the north.  I don't know if it's true, but "
"I have to try.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The wind howls through the empty streets, like the world itself is "
"mourning.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They scream when they burn.  The sound haunts me.  But it's the only way to"
" be sure.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Found a severed hand today.  It was clutching a note that read 'Kill me.'\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I can hear the whispers in my head.  They tell me to do things.  Horrible "
"things.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The darkness is alive.  I swear I saw it move.  It's watching me.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I tried to cut it out, but it just keeps growing.  I can feel it under my "
"skin, crawling.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The baby was stillborn.  We didn't bury it.  It got up and walked away.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I watched as they tore him apart, piece by piece.  He was still screaming "
"when they started eating his guts.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Don't trust the shadows.  They move when you're not looking.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I can't sleep.  Every time I close my eyes, I see their faces.  The ones I "
"couldn't save.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I thought I heard my mom calling me from the basement.  But she's been dead"
" for years.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They don't just bite.  They infect you with something.  You start to rot "
"from the inside out.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I keep hearing scratching in the walls.  Something's in there, trying to "
"get out.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found a pile of bones today.  They were arranged in a circle, like some "
"kind of ritual.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"There's something wrong with the air.  It tastes… metallic.  Makes my head "
"feel heavy.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I saw my reflection in the mirror, but it wasn't me.  It smiled and its "
"eyes were black.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They don't just kill you.  They take over your body, use you like a "
"puppet.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I woke up covered in blood.  I don't know whose blood it is.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The voices are getting louder.  They tell me to do unspeakable things.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I found a tooth embedded in my arm.  It wasn't mine.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Saw a man eating his own fingers today.  He didn't stop until he choked on "
"the bones.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The ground outside my house is moving, like it's breathing.  I can't go out"
" there.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I heard children laughing in the forest.  There are no children left.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Something's growing inside me.  I can feel it moving, shifting.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I saw a woman gouging out her eyes.  Said she didn't want to see the "
"monsters anymore.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Don't drink the water.  It makes you see things.  Terrible things.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They don't have faces anymore.  Just blank, smooth skin.  And they "
"scream.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I found a room full of dolls.  Their eyes followed me as I moved.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Something's wrong with the sky.  It's… pulsating.  Like it's alive.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The flies are everywhere.  They whisper secrets in your ears.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found a journal.  It describes rituals.  Dark, horrifying rituals.  I "
"think they worked.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The birds are watching us.  They're not birds anymore.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Heard someone singing today.  Followed the sound, but there was no one "
"there.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I saw a man turn inside out.  His screams still echo in my ears.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I found a hand nailed to a tree.  It was pointing west.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The rain burns.  It's like acid.  My skin is covered in blisters.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Something crawled out of the sewer today.  It wasn't human.  It wasn't "
"anything I've ever seen.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I watched my friend rot alive.  It started with his eyes, then his skin "
"just peeled away.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I found a child's shoe.  It was filled with teeth.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The trees have faces now.  They whisper my name when I pass by.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I saw a man dragging his entrails behind him.  He was still alive, begging "
"for help.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Don't trust the light.  It draws you in, but it's a trap.  A trap set by "
"them.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found a cocoon.  Something inside was moving.  It looked almost… human.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I saw a face in the fog.  It wasn't human.  It smiled at me.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The ground is covered in blood.  It's seeping up from below.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I hear them in the walls.  Scratching, clawing.  They're coming.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I found a mirror.  My reflection waved at me, but I didn't move.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They've started to speak.  Their voices are garbled, but they're learning "
"our language.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I saw a man without a shadow today.  He looked right through me, like I "
"wasn't there.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The sun never sets anymore.  It just hangs there, glaring down at us.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my dearest Emily, if you're reading this, I want you to know that I "
"never stopped looking for you.  Please be safe.  I love you more than "
"anything.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Sarah, I'm so sorry I couldn't keep my promise.  I tried to get back, but "
"they were everywhere.  I hope you made it to the shelter.  I love you, "
"forever.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mom, if you find this, know that I'm sorry.  I should've listened to you "
"and stayed put.  I hope you're safe.  Love, your stubborn son.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dear Lily, daddy's gone to find food.  I'll be back soon.  Be brave for me,"
" princess.  I love you to the moon and back.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anna, I found a safe place.  Follow the trail of red ribbons.  I'll be "
"waiting for you.  I love you, always.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my beloved wife, I've gone to find help.  If I don't make it, please "
"remember our happy times and stay strong.  All my love, always.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Michael, I heard there's a safe zone up north.  I'm heading there.  Please,"
" if you're still alive, meet me there.  I can't do this without you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my little brother, I'm so sorry I wasn't there to protect you.  I hope "
"you're with mom and dad now.  I miss you more than words can say.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Ellie, if you find this, I'm heading to the coast.  I pray you're safe and "
"we'll be together soon.  I love you, now and always.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dear John, I waited as long as I could.  Supplies are running low, and I "
"need to move on.  Please find me.  I'll be leaving signs.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my sweet daughter, I left your favorite doll in the blue house on Elm "
"Street.  I hope it gives you comfort.  Stay safe, my angel.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dear Maria, I think of you every day.  I'm sorry for all the fights.  I'd "
"give anything to see your smile again.  I love you, always.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Jake, if you find this, I'm sorry I couldn't be stronger.  Please forgive "
"me and stay alive for both of us.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my darling wife, I'm sorry I couldn't protect our family.  I hope you "
"and the kids are somewhere safe.  I love you all so much.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"My love, I've gone to find medicine.  I'll be back.  Hold on just a little "
"longer.  I can't lose you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my brave little boy, daddy had to leave to find food.  Be strong and "
"take care of mommy.  I love you more than anything.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Rachel, every night I dream of you.  I hope you're safe and we'll see each "
"other again.  I miss you so much.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dear Sam, I found a safe place.  Look for the red X on the old barn.  I'll "
"be waiting for you.  Stay strong.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my beautiful wife, I don't know if I'll make it back.  But please know "
"that you and the kids were my everything.  I love you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"My dear Emma, I left a map in the old treehouse.  Follow it to find me.  "
"I'm sorry I couldn't be there to protect you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my beloved family, I tried my best to keep us all together.  If you find"
" this, please remember me and take care of each other.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dad, I'm heading to the city to find help.  Please be safe and wait for me."
" I love you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dear Laura, the world is a nightmare now, but I hold onto the hope that "
"you're safe.  I love you more than life itself.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mom, I'm so sorry I left.  I thought I could find food.  Please forgive me "
"and stay safe.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my sweet son, I've hidden some supplies in the attic.  Be brave and "
"remember I love you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Jessica, if you're reading this, I made it to the old cabin.  It's safe "
"here.  Please come find me.  I need you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my loving husband, I'm sorry I couldn't hold on longer.  I hope you find"
" peace and remember our love.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mom, dad, I'm heading to the farm.  If you're out there, meet me there.  I "
"miss you both so much.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my little sister, I left you a teddy bear in the bunker.  Hold onto it "
"and know I'm always with you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dear Mark, I've gone to look for a way out.  If you find this, know that I "
"love you and will always be with you in spirit.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Sarah, I think of you every day.  I hope you're alive and we'll find each "
"other again.  I love you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my dear wife, I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.  Please forgive me.  I "
"love you eternally.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my brave daughter, if you find this, know that daddy loves you and is "
"always with you, even if you can't see me.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anna, I found shelter in the old mill.  It's safe here.  Please come find "
"me.  I need you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my darling son, I've left you all the supplies I could gather.  Be "
"strong and know that I love you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"My dearest Emily, I'm sorry I couldn't be there to protect you.  I hope "
"you're somewhere safe.  I love you so much.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my sweet wife, I tried to find help but I'm running out of time.  Please"
" stay strong.  I love you always.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mom, I'm sorry for everything.  I hope you're safe.  I love you more than "
"words can say.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dear John, I found a place to hide.  It's safe for now.  Please come find "
"me.  I miss you.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To my beloved daughter, I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.  I love you with "
"all my heart.  Stay strong.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The bark of this \"plant\" has a bark like texture, but is more leathery in "
"consistency."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The smell emanating from the creature when you dissect it reminds you of "
"vegetables."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid "The monster's sap is sticky and somewhat greenish."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"While outwardly plant like, the creature's muscles look surprisingly similar "
"to those of normal animals."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Thick fibers are found throughout the body of the creature.  Perhaps they "
"serve a scaffolding purpose similar to that of (very flexible) bones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The creature's whip like sting drips from poison.  You take extra care not to"
" accidentally scratch yourself on it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The creature appears to have a vascular system vaguely similar to those of "
"animals, with a branching network of vein, although the organization is "
"unfamiliar."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You find what you think is a heart, although it doesn't look like any "
"configuration you know of from Earth.  In fact, you find four hearts, each "
"seemingly supporting a lateral quarter of the body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A sac connected to the sting is filled with some fluid.  Might it perhaps "
"have some useful properties?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"While the roots of the plant creature contain muscles and veins, they also "
"contain finer networks indicating a use for nutrient uptake when the roots "
"are lodged into the soil."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<triffid_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/triffid_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"At the top of the creature you find what you assume is a brain, although it "
"seems to employ quadrilateral symmetry and thus is shaped and organized "
"completely differently from that of terrestrial versions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Blocked"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "There's nothing that way but a plane of featureless black."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"With all this glass, you expected it to be brighter here.  It's not.  That's "
"okay, it would have hurt your eyes otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "A gust of wind blows across the farm.  Glass chimes in the breeze."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "You are suddenly very aware of your heartbeat, but only for a moment."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The glass around you isn't sparkling; it doesn't reflect.  The glimmers that "
"cross it in the corner of your eye are your imagination."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "It's very cold here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You didn't realize there had been an ache at the base of your neck all day "
"until just now, when you notice it's gone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"There's nothing here, really.  How long has it been since you've felt truly "
"safe?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You find yourself wondering what the glass tastes like.  You're ashamed of "
"the thought."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The glass is solid under your feet.  It supports you completely, but the "
"feeling of it under your feet is dull, somehow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You can't see it's light, but you know the sun is there.  It's the same "
"perfect black as the rest of the sky."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You are seized with a brief desire to smash something, anything.  You don't "
"know why you'd think such an unseemly thing.  It doesn't feel at all like "
"you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The edges of the glass are very sharp.  But that is the nature of glass.  "
"Isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You think, for a moment, that you might start flying.  You don't, but it "
"doesn't trouble you much."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Somewhere, inside a ribcage, something is beating very fast.  Something about"
" that strikes you as very funny."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "How long has it been since you blinked?  It probably doesn't matter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You spend a moment looking at your reflection in the glass.  What a nice "
"smile you have!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"How very smooth it all is.  Even the sharp parts; especially the sharp parts."
"  Pristine, and perfect."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "You're so glad you decided to visit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You were shivering, a little bit ago.  It's stopped now.  You must have "
"warmed up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Everything seems so much more real than usual.  It's all right there.  Reach "
"out; touch it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The place you left behind was much worse than this.  All noise and uneven "
"edges."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Perhaps you should rest?  The furniture here is all hard glass, but you're "
"sure it won't trouble you.  You can't imagine anything hurting, here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "The people here are so kind.  Their smiles are so bright."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Everything here is in its proper place.  Except you.  But there's still time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Some of the dust is blown up into a thick cloud.  You take a deep lungful; "
"it's like incense, but cleaner."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Your teeth are the best part of you, really."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Before you decided to visit, you might have thought you were feeling pain.  "
"How silly you were!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"It feels like your ribs are finally able to tuck inwards, where they belong, "
"now that all that mess and noise is settling down."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "What a wonderful place.  What a wonderful place!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You catch a glimpse of your hands.  They're all wrong.  They won't do at all."
"  Not all askew like this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The glass is singing.  Or is that you?  No, it's both.  Your voices are "
"beautiful together."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"When you turn your head, you can hear the wet click of tendons in your neck."
"  How dreadful.  It won't be a problem, soon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"It would be a very good idea to lie down and close your eyes.  You could "
"listen to the glass sing you to sleep."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Your head feels heavy on your neck, your arms heavy on your shoulders.  What "
"an awful demand, to expect you to hold them up with a few strips of muscle.  "
"You poor thing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"What a blessing it is, to be in a place without distractions like this.  What"
" a joy, to think clearly for the first time in your life."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You were thinking about leaving, before.  You don't remember why; the thought"
" has been trimmed so neatly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Stand straighter.  Straighter.  Not like that.  How will you ever fit in like"
" that?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The wind stirs the glass, and interrupts its melody with ugly noise.  You "
"think you might like to kill the wind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You remember thinking they were reflections.  You laugh, high and bright and "
"perfect."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Your nerves are alight.  Not crackling like they were before; instead, "
"perfect snaps, one two three one two three four."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You'd really like to sit down.  No, no, not that; and let your heavy head bow"
" your spine?  Lying would be much better.  Lying flat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"There are so many parts of you that are wrong.  But that's not their fault.  "
"Once they're clipped away and laid out, they'll all fit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Every move you make, your bones crackle and pop.  They're getting closer.  "
"How wonderful!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Something somewhere is screaming.  Forcing air out of the nasty sacks in its "
"chest.  You're so glad that's not you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"For the first time in your life, you are free of the ugly sound of your pulse"
" in your ears.  How did you ever function, beaten down by that hideous "
"rhythm?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_4"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"It's been quite a while since you had a thought.  Noticing that, itself, "
"screeches unpleasantly in your cold, clear mind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You try to walk in time, one two three one two three four, but your legs "
"aren't right.  They need to be fixed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Something is pushing out from under your skin.  Taking the ugly mess away, to"
" iron it flat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You don't have enough edges.  You could fix that.  Right now.  Look; the "
"glass is so sharp."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Don't let go of this.  Cling tighter.  No, tighter.  If it breaks, the pieces"
" will be prettier anyway."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Look how well it all fits together.  Nice, neat lines.  The curves are the "
"best; a million little lines and a million again."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Stop moving.  You're ruining it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You can't cut well enough yet, but you're so close.  Smaller and sharper and "
"cleaner, all of it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Every motion shaves you down, finer and finer and finer and finer and finer "
"and finer."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"It's so selfish of you to keep yourself this ugly whole, when you could be so"
" many perfect pieces."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You have brought pain to this place of peace; the pain of being incorrect.  "
"It is awful of you.  But you are forgiven."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Such a rare and beautiful blessing, you have been given.  You are so grateful"
" that you might cry, if you still needed that ugly function."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You've done so well!  You've been so patient, while you are being fixed.  "
"This is why you were chosen for it.  You deserve it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_5"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Sleep now.  It will be dreamless, and empty, as it always should have been."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Thoughts are slow now.  Simple.  Clean."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Sharper.  Sharper.  Sharper."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "You're almost complete."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "You should rest.  You've never rested before now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "You're glittering.  Finally, you're glittering."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "This is it.  Your flourishing.  Your apotheosis."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The parts of you you don't need are howling.  They don't understand yet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "All your facets are here.  Every one smooth, perfect."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Cold.  So cold.  Perfect.  Perfect."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The song.  The silence.  The song.  The silence.  The song.  The silence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Smooth.  Clean.  The best of you, finally."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Almost nothing left now.  It's all been shaved away."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Look how you catch the light, now.  Never look away."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Be still, now.  There is nothing left to do."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Edges.  Lines.  Points.  Happy.  Happy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Ambient_6"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Let go, now.  Let what you are clutching become perfect too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Final"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You don't think about what has happened to you.  You don't think, ever again."
"  There's no need.  Every part of you is finally as it should be."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Blood drips from your cuts.  It doesn't reach the ground."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Your cuts don't hurt anymore.  Or do they?  It's different, somehow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Blood falls from your wounds in ugly little drops.  It's disgusting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_1"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "You feel a little better, with some of your blood gone.  Cleaner."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"It's horrible, the stuff dripping from you.  How kind it is of the glass to "
"let you be free of it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You are not open enough.  How will you be clean and dry, with only these few "
"little cuts?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Your blood isn't quite liquid anymore.  Slurry, like crushed ice.  It's not "
"good enough yet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_2"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Out it comes, the nasty fluid sloshing through your tubes.  Out it comes to "
"be fixed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "More.  Bleed more.  You're almost clean."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid "Your fluids are so ugly.  You're so close to being free."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Look.  You're bleeding snowflakes.  A thousand little parts of you are "
"finding themselves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Bleed_3"
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
msgid ""
"If you broke your skin just a little more, it would be that much easier to "
"lift it away."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This looks like a stomach and length of intestine, if they were made of lung "
"tissue.  Every now and then you notice it expanding or contracting slightly."
"  It looks dangerous to eat, maybe even to handle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A clump of rotten entrails.  The sallow membranes that link these lobes of "
"flesh together are lined with blackened veins and capillaries.  A caul of "
"slime coats them all in a greasy sheen.  You should not put this anywhere "
"near your mouth."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Zombie guts.  Your appetite may have been spoiled by one look at the twisted,"
" compacted tubes and sacs that form this clump of foul entrails.  Why then "
"does it make you think of frozen spaghetti and meatballs?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The inner contents of the walking dead.  It's hard to tell exactly what kind "
"of tissue this may have once been.  Several structures appear to have molded "
"together."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The stained skull of what was once a human being.  It is rotted and "
"noticeably warped from its living form."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The stained skull of a former human.  Whatever turned their flesh to walking "
"in death, it left its mark on their bones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A rotted skull from a human zombie.  It feels more flexible than it should, "
"like stiff leather, no longer natural bone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The brain has ossified inside this tainted skull.  It doesn't feel noticeably"
" heavier and you surmise that the brain-turned-bone must be deeply porous or "
"hollow itself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This pitted human skull is filled with teeth, few of them where they should "
"be.  You can see them growing in the hollows that have developed, their roots"
" grown long and winding, more like those of a tree."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The teeth of this lopsided human skull have melded together like hot wax and "
"joined with the maxilla.  The eye sockets are drooping and canted to the side"
" as if shaped while soft.  Most of the suture joints of the cranium are fused"
" over with thick lines of growth as if soldered together with bone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A rotted and then shredded arm.  Not much use unless you want to scrape the "
"rancid meat from the bones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Little tainted meat remains on whatever limb bones these were.  It still "
"bends at the joint but doesn't look to be moving on its own anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This jaundiced zombie's arm still bears a full sleeve tattoo.  Quality work "
"from what you can tell through all the rot."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "leg_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You think this decaying severed limb ends in a foot.  It's actually hard to "
"tell after the hell it's been through."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "leg_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A fat zombie haunch.  It doesn't look tasty but the shape is undeniably close"
" to a large fried chicken leg.  The skin is even the right texture, though "
"for the wrong reasons."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As you make your first cut into its skin, a pressurized jet of decaying blood"
" almost hits your face."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The overbearing sweet smell of decay emanating from the carcass forces you to"
" take short breaks during your work to not puke."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "As you cut through the muscle, it tenses up in reaction."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You spot a few flies and maggots in the corpse, their chosen carcass not "
"seeming to be very good for them, as most seem moribund."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Random cavities in its body make you think it was at least partially feeding "
"on its own tissues to keep functioning."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The corpse twitches as you begin.  It didn't feel like rigor mortis."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The body stirs as you open it up, suggesting it's still trying to attack, and"
" reminding you to be cautious."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You begin your dissection - though, vivisection would be more appropriate, as"
" you find the corpse not as still as you once thought."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The majority of the digestive tract seems to have reshaped into a singular "
"stomach."
msgstr ""
